as am I every day.

00:06:17.477 --> 00:06:19.311
But the other day,
she was just like,

00:06:19.311 --> 00:06:23.115
"The garbage man's test
is coming up this week."

00:06:23.115 --> 00:06:24.784
She goes, "It's a lovely job.

00:06:24.784 --> 00:06:28.788
You work for the city.
You get a uniform."

00:06:28.788 --> 00:06:31.624
[ Laughter ]

00:06:31.624 --> 00:06:33.492
-You were like,
"I've got a show on Tubi!"

00:06:33.492 --> 00:06:36.062
-On Tubi, dude. Tubin' it up.

